            "sid": "NEH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo twabaire tukora omurimo, ekicweka kyabo kimwe kikwata amacumu, okwiha omu kasheeshe nibutaagurikana okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, ahu enyonyoozi zireebekyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri obwo bunaku naagaruka naagmbira abantu nti: Buri muntu n'omuhuuku we bagume baraare omuri Yerusaalemu, babone kuturinda nyekiro, n'okukora nyomushana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo tihariho n'omwe omuriitwe owaabaire ajuura ebijwaro bye, yaaba nyowe, nari beene tata, nari abashaija bangye, n'obu baakuba abarinzi abaabaire bangyenda enyima; buri muntu akaba aza kutaha amaizi, aine eky'okurwanisa kye omu ngaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.23"
            ]
          }
